sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant API as API Gateway (AWS_IAM)
    participant Upload as Upload Lambda
    participant Idem as Idempotency Service\n(DynamoDB claim-and-cache)
    participant DDB as DynamoDB\ndocuments-metadata
    participant S3 as S3 documents bucket
    participant EB as EventBridge
    participant SFN as Step Functions

    Client->>API: POST /documents\n{fileName, contentType}\nx-idempotency-key
    API->>Upload: invoke
    Upload->>Idem: claim(idempotencyKey)
    alt key already COMPLETED (duplicate request)
        Idem-->>Upload: cached result
        Upload-->>API: 200 (cached uploadUrl)
    else new key or IN_PROGRESS crash-recovery
        Idem-->>Upload: proceed
        Upload->>Upload: generate documentId
        Upload->>DDB: PutItem status=UPLOADED
        Upload->>S3: presigned PUT URL
        Upload->>Idem: mark COMPLETED (cache result)
        Upload-->>API: 200 {documentId, uploadUrl}
    end
    API-->>Client: 200 {documentId, uploadUrl}

    Client->>S3: PUT file (presigned URL)
    S3->>EB: ObjectCreated event
    EB->>SFN: StartExecution(name=documentId)
    Note over SFN: Duplicate S3 events for the same\ndocumentId hit ExecutionAlreadyExists\nand are safely ignored (no re-processing)
    SFN->>DDB: UpdateItem status=PROCESSING

    Client->>API: GET /documents/{documentId}
    API->>DDB: GetItem
    DDB-->>API: status, timestamps, errorMessage
    API-->>Client: 200 current status
